# Conditional mutation keeps the runtime element subtype

Verifies a mutation in an unexecuted conditional branch does not make a later
read assume that branch's subtype; the original millimeter value still adds as
`11mm`.

>>> source
let sizes: int[] = [10mm]
if (false) {
    sizes[0] = 2cm
}
print(sizes[0] + 1mm)

<<< stdout
11mm

<<< stderr
